## CHAPTER THREE: RESEARCH METHODOLOGY

### 3.1 Research Design
The Agile software development methodology was adopted to allow iterative improvements to the UI and backend logic.

### 3.2 System Architecture & Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** React Native (Expo) replacing Flutter for better web/PWA compatibility and cross-platform performance.
- **Backend:** Kotlin (Ktor) deployed via Docker.
- **Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL) with Row Level Security (RLS).
- **Mapping:** OpenStreetMap (OSM) and OSRM for custom campus routing.
- **State Management:** Zustand (React Native).

### 3.3 Method of Data Collection
GPS coordinates for DOU faculties and gates were mapped using Osmium. Driver and student records are managed via Supabase Auth.

